# @?CAL - PRINT A GREGORIAN MONTH

## @?OPERANDS

### @?[NUMBER]
[NUMBER] OPERAND.

### @?[NUMBER]
[NUMBER] OPERAND.

## DESCRIPTION

CAL PRINTS JANUARY 1970 BY DEFAULT OR THE REQUESTED MONTH AND YEAR.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
